<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Getting rid of things</h1>
<p>You are encouraged not to leave things lying around, as it clutters up the 
game. Some ways to get rid of what you don't want:
</p>
<ul><li><b>Donate it</b> to others who may need it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Donate</a>): the thing goes</li></ul>
<pre> to a donation room where anyone can pick it up.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>Bury it</b> (see <a cmd='#'>Help Bury</a>): it is gone from sight, and in time gone for</li></ul>
<pre> good.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>Drop it at the dump</b>, the Village Waste Heap south of Guild Road in</li></ul>
<pre> Udgaard, by the boat bridge: what is dropped there isn't seen again.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>Sell it</b>, if a shop trades in that kind of thing (see <a cmd='#'>Help Shops</a>).</li></ul>
<p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Donate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bury</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Shops</a>
</pre>




</div>